 '27.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/07/boot-barn-boot-q1-2027-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BOOT 2027 Q2","e":"boot","d":"2026-10-28","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"John Hazen","x":"At the midpoint of our fiscal year, revenue has increased 16% to date, and earnings per diluted share have increased 15% excluding the impact of tariff refunds.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/29/boot-barn-boot-q2-2027-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BOOT 2027 Q2","e":"boot","d":"2026-10-28","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"John Hazen","x":"Excluding the impact of tariffs, second quarter merchandise margin exceeded our expectations, increasing 150 basis points on top of 80 basis points of expansion in the prior year period.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/29/boot-barn-boot-q2-2027-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BOOT 2027 Q2","e":"boot","d":"2026-10-28","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"James Watkins","x":"Having to lower the guidance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/29/boot-barn-boot-q2-2027-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BOOT 2027 Q2","e":"boot","d":"2026-10-28","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"Jonathan Komp","x":"Does not--yeah, it does not appear consistent with your past or at least not frequently that you have had periods of comp slowdowns and have to lower guidance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/29/boot-barn-boot-q2-2027-earnings-call-transcript/"}],"trends":{"theater":[[33,1,10245,0,0,0,8256,1563],[36,1,8212,0,0,0,6465,1309],[37,1,8836,0,0,0,7136,1332],[38,1,9853,0,0,0,7827,1609],[39,1,10496,0,0,0,8312,1715],[40,1,11143,0,0,0,8509,1981],[41,1,12055,0,0,0,9947,1564],[42,1,10791,0,0,0,8923,1422],[43,1,11590,0,0,0,8825,2195],[44,1,10958,0,0,0,8460,1916],[45,1,11708,0,0,0,9273,1917],[46,1,11480,1,0,1,8578,2426],[47,1,10536,0,0,0,8634,1473],[64,1,9258,0,0,0,6996,1793],[65,1,9752,0,0,0,7410,1760],[66,1,9404